# A survey quadcopter, as opposed to ArduPilot's bare SITL quad: a camera the mission's
# DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL / IMAGE_START_CAPTURE items can actually fire (CAMERA_FEEDBACK is
# the evidence), a servo gimbal for DO_MOUNT_CONTROL, and mission storage on the SD card.
# Stock SITL storage holds 650 mission items -- about what a Pixhawk's FRAM holds -- and
# structure templates over a modest site exceed it; that limit is tested separately
# against a stock vehicle (test_copter_mission_rejection.py).
CAM1_TYPE 1
SERVO9_FUNCTION 10
MNT1_TYPE 1
SERVO10_FUNCTION 7
MNT1_PITCH_MIN -90
MNT1_PITCH_MAX 30
BRD_SD_MISSION 256
